<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct soybean exports down 51.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct soybean exports down 51.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's soybean exports fell 51.2 percent to 150,000 tonnes in the first 10 months of 1996 compared with the same period a year ago, the Futures Herald said on Monday, quoting customs figures.</p>
<p>There were no exports in October, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>It did not give import figures.</p>
</text>
